  "all_ingredients_flat": "potatoes, kala chana (brown chickpeas), cilantro, salt, soy yogurt, red Kashmiri chilli powder, green chillies, roasted cumin powder, tamarind, dates",
  "instructions": "+ ALOO TIKKI: Combine boiled potatoes & boiled kala chana (brown chickpeas) in approximately 1:1 ratio. Add some cilantro and a pinch of salt (to taste). Mash them together. Shape them into burger patties or 'tikkis'. Cook on a preheated cast iron tawa on medium low heat until both sides are crispy.\n+ ALOO TIKKI CHAAT: Put Aloo Tikki on a plate. Spread some lightly beaten soy yogurt. Add some red Kashmiri chilli powder, chopped green chillies, roasted cumin powder and a pinch of salt (to taste). Garnish with chopped cilantro and homemade Tamarind Date Chutney.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "saute",
    "no-cook"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Garnish with chopped cilantro and homemade Tamarind Date Chutney.",
  "notes": "A recipe with BEANS (kala chana, soy yogurt), TUBERS (potatoes), HERBS & SPICES (various). Homemade Tamarind Date Chutney is a component.",
